<div class="surfdoc-summary" role="doc-abstract"><div class="surfdoc-summary-label">Summary</div><p><p>The 0.18 responsive axis: typed layouts, per-size-class values, and
class-conditional chrome. Rendered at 390 / 834 / 1280 to pin all three
classes.</p>
</p></div>
